# SSU2 Transport Implementation

This directory contains the SSU2 (Secure Semi-reliable UDP version 2) transport implementation.

SSU2 is based on:
- Noise Protocol Framework (XK pattern)
- X25519 for key exchange
- ChaCha20-Poly1305 for encryption
- SHA256 for hashing

Key differences from SSU1:
- Uses Noise XK handshake instead of DH
- ChaCha20-Poly1305 AEAD instead of AES-CBC + HMAC
- Header obfuscation with ChaCha20
- Improved resistance to traffic analysis
- Connection migration support
- Path validation
